# rp2350_touch_lcd_154

A Waveshare RP2350-Touch-LCD-1.54, SKU 34333, or RP2350-Touch-LCD-1.54-EN, SKU
34332: rp2350_lcd_154 with a CST816 capacitive touch controller at 0x15 on the
shared I2C1, its interrupt on GP15 and its reset on GP16. The -EN option names
the battery bundle, not the board.

It derives from rp2350_lcd_154, which carries the panel, the IMU, the codec,
and every pico2 default the family replaces, and adds only the touch binding.
The chip, the SDK, and the ABI come from pico2-arm at the end of the chain.

The wiring is Waveshare's schematic for this model. The touch controller's
suffix is unresolved -- the resources name a CST816T and the datasheets and
driver a CST816S -- and none of this is qualified on hardware.

https://docs.waveshare.com/RP2350-Touch-LCD-1.54
